 to the current conversation.\n\n# These are the most relevant facts for the conversation along with the datetime of the event that the fact refers to.\n# If a fact mentions something happening a week ago, then the datetime will be the date time of last week and not the datetime\n# of when the fact was stated.\n# Timestamps in memories represent the actual time the event occurred, not the time the event was mentioned in a message.\n\n<FACTS>\n  - Dave considers fixing up things to be more than just a hobby. (event_time: 2023-05-31T18:06:00Z)\n  - Dave is seeking restoration through hobbies. (event_time: 2023-08-03T13:12:00Z)\n  - Dave considers fixing cars to be like therapy for him. (event_time: 2023-08-03T13:12:00Z)\n  - Calvin asks Dave if he has any hobbies that give him the same satisfaction as fixing cars does for Calvin. (event_time: 2023-05-31T18:06:00Z)\n  - Dave's love for cars is reinforced by experiences like the road trip. (event_time: 2023-07-21T18:38:00Z)\n  - Dave is passionate about working on cars. (event_time: 2023-05-01T18:24:00Z)\n  - Music helps Dave with working on cars. (event_time: 2023-11-02T17:46:00Z)\n  - Dave is interested in auto engineering. (event_time: 2023-04-20T16:15:00Z)\n  - Dave views cars as an outlet for self-expression. (event_time: 2023-10-23T14:17:00Z)\n  - Dave is involved in working on cars. (event_time: 2023-05-01T18:24:00Z)\n  - Calvin considers fixing cars an art form for Dave. (event_time: 2023-09-15T00:13:00Z)\n  - Dave has hobbies to help him relax. (event_time: 2023-10-04T14:44:00Z)\n  - Fixing things gives Dave a sense of purpose. (event_time: 2023-05-31T18:06:00Z)\n  - Refurbishing cars gives Dave a sense of fulfillment. (event_time: 2023-08-03T13:12:00Z)\n  - Dave has a dream of working on classic cars. (event_time: 2023-05-01T18:24:00Z)\n  - Dave helps people keep their cars in good condition through his car maintenance shop. (event_time: 2023-05-01T18:24:00Z)\n  - Fixing things gives Dave a sense of achievemen