k Ocean and enjoying amazing crowd energy. He is excited to explore Tokyo, specifically Shibuya Crossing and Shinjuku, and try the amazing food there.\n  - podcast: Calvin recorded a podcast following a studio session with Frank Ocean in Tokyo; Dave is excited to hear it when it's uploaded.\n  - the tour: Calvin is touring with Frank Ocean, finding the performance energizing with great crowd connection. He acknowledges fame presents challenges in balancing his job and personal life.\n  - studio: Calvin's music studio was complimented by Dave. Calvin recorded a song with Frank Ocean there after meeting at a Tokyo music festival; it also has a cozy relaxation room.\n  - concerts: Calvin is touring with Frank Ocean and values concerts for the connection between artist and crowd. Calvin watches concerts for inspiration and industry learning.\n  - music scene: Calvin toured with Frank Ocean, finding the Tokyo crowd insane. He is excited about the music scene and Dave will cheer him on in Boston.\n  - Performing live: Calvin toured with Frank Ocean, finding performing live in Tokyo wild, incredible, and an indescribable high that fuels his soul and connection with the crowd.\n  - mansion: Calvin threw a party for his new album at his Japanese house/mansion, following a prior event where he recorded a song there after meeting Frank Ocean.\n  - microphone: Calvin saved his favorite microphone after his place flooded. Dave expressed sympathy and offered help. Calvin recently toured with Frank Ocean.\n  - clips: Calvin loves the Miami vibe for the vid clips and is excited to show them after collaborating with artists to create something unique.\n  - spotlight: Dave wished Calvin many more electrifying moments in the spotlight after his tour with Frank Ocean.\n  - Fireworks: The Fireworks headlined a festival and recently performed with Frank Ocean, with Calvin noting the electric crowd energy.\n  - strategies: Dave asked Calvin for strategies Calvin uses to manage everything,