e he met while walking Max.\n  - new tank: Nate got a new tank for his turtles because he bought another one; the tank is now large enough for three turtles.\n  - Nate: Nate made homemade coconut ice cream with sprinkles. His game tournament was postponed, and he didn't make the finals. He creates YouTube gaming content. He expressed support for Joanna filming her movie.\n  - an idea: Joanna got ideas for characters from people she knows, things she saw, and her imagination, seeing them take shape with wants and worries.\n  - frosting: Nate commented that the frosting looked really good and he loves the way it turned out.\n  - the set: Joanna is filming her own movie on the set, which she describes as awesome and full of potential every day.\n</ENTITIES>\n","context_tokens":1987,"context_chars":7707,"retrieval_duration":0.16785287857055664,"response_duration":2.499312400817871,"total_duration":2.6671652793884277,"grade":true,"grade_reasoning":"The generated answer touches on the same topic of the stuffed animal being a reminder of good vibes, which aligns with the gold answer.","completeness_grade":"COMPLETE","completeness_reasoning":"The context provides all necessary information to answer the question about how Nate describes the stuffed animal he got for Joanna. It mentions that the stuffed animal is a dog named Tilly, which is a nice reminder for Joanna and is meant to remind Nate of good vibes. This aligns perfectly with the golden answer, which states it is a stuffed animal to remind Joanna of the good vibes.","missing_elements":[],"present_elements":["Nate gave Joanna a stuffed animal dog.","The stuffed animal is a nice reminder for Joanna.","The stuffed animal is meant to remind Nate of good vibes."]},{"user_id":null,"graph_id":"v2_full_onto_2_experiment_graph_9","test_id":"v2_full_onto_2_graph_9_qa_53","category":"1","difficulty":"unknown","query":"Who supports Calvin in tough times?","golden_answer":"friends and team","hypothesis":"Calvin is supported in t