ith a new health routine despite feeling pressured, and is planning a hike with Evan.\n  - Sam: Sam is having health issues, feeling weighed down, but is trying to stay positive. Sam asked Evan how his partner took the news about the rose bushes.\n  - eating right: Evan stressed that eating right is just as important as exercising for health changes, in a discussion with Sam.\n  - Sam: Sam is sticking with a tough change to live healthier and was asked by Evan about starting painting classes years ago and why they joined now when they are already good at drawing.\n  - Evan: Evan had a health scare last week (heart palpitation incident) and is now focused on eating less processed food and sugary snacks.\n</ENTITIES>\n","context_tokens":2005,"context_chars":8049,"retrieval_duration":0.3588399887084961,"response_duration":2.1503589153289795,"total_duration":2.5091989040374756,"grade":true,"grade_reasoning":"The generated answer mentions soda and sugary snacks, which aligns with the unhealthy snacks referenced in the gold answer.","completeness_grade":"COMPLETE","completeness_reasoning":"The context provides all necessary information to answer the question about the unhealthy snacks Sam enjoys. It explicitly states that Sam enjoys soda and candy, which are the exact items mentioned in the golden answer. Additionally, the context includes details about Sam's struggles with unhealthy snacks and cravings, reinforcing the information about his preferences.","missing_elements":[],"present_elements":["soda","candy","unhealthy snacks","sugary snacks","sugary drinks"]},{"user_id":null,"graph_id":"v2_full_onto_2_experiment_graph_4","test_id":"v2_full_onto_2_graph_4_qa_48","category":"1","difficulty":"unknown","query":"When did John get an ankle injury in 2023?","golden_answer":"around November 16, 2023","hypothesis":"John did not get an ankle injury in 2023. His ankle injury occurred on January 1, 2022. The most recent information indicates that he has been experiencing difficulties related to an injury during the week of November 16, 2023, but this does not specify a new ankle injury.","context":"\nFACTS and ENTITIES represent relevant context to the current conversation.\n\n# These are the most relevant facts for the conversation along with the datetime of the event that the fact refers to.\n# If a fact mentions something happening a week ago, then the datetime will be the date time of last week and not the datetime\n# of when the fact was stated.\n# Timestamps in memories represent the actual time the event occurred, not the time the event was mentioned in a message.\n\n<FACTS>\n  - John hurt his ankle during last season. (event_time: 2022-01-01T00:00:00Z)\n  - John has been experiencing difficulties related to an injury during the current week. (event_time: 2023-11-16T15:59:00Z)\n  - John injured himself sometime before the current message was sent, causing him to miss b-ball games. (event_time: None)\n  - John needed time off because of his ankle injury. (event_time: 2022-01-01T00:00:00Z)\n  - John is currently experiencing a rough Injury. (event_time: 2023-11-16T15:59:00Z)\n  - The injury to John's ankle required physical therapy. (event_time: 2022-01-01T00:00:00Z)\n  - Tim mentions John's Injury in conversation. (event_time: 2023-11-21T10:22:00Z)\n  - Tim hopes John's injury heals soon. (event_time: 2023-11-16T15:59:00Z)\n  - John could not play or help the team due to his injury. (event_time: 2022-01-01T00:00:00Z)\n  - John had a tree last year. (event_time: 2022-01-01T00:00:00Z)\n  - Tim acknowledges John's injury and expresses sympathy (event_time: 2023-11-16T15:59:00Z)\n  - John mentioned that something exciting happened to him recently. (event_time: 2024-01-12T13:41:00Z)\n  - John participated in a basketball game last year where his team was trailing significantly in the 4th quarter. (event_time: 2022-01-01T00:00:00Z)\n  - John used to practice basketball for hours when he was younger (event_time: None)\n  - John was unable to